  "n1": {
   "x": 6140,
   "y": 40,
   "w": 420,
   "text": "Every word the reader reads is verbatim Saki, from Project Gutenberg #269. The answer options are things and people from the passage \u2014 never lettered A/B/C/D. Oxblood red is reserved for the reader's own evidence marks, so a red stroke always means \"I claimed this\".",
   "color": "red"
  },
  "n2": {
   "x": 6140,
   "y": 1480,
   "w": 420,
   "text": "One continuous study, six depth layers, lit only by the desk lamp. Each frame is a camera position on that one room \u2014 which is what makes Search the Room work: the decoys are objects you already walked past.",
   "color": "red"
  }
 },
